; G05 — Named slots ≡ hex rewrite (Appendix F, Part 8 / Phase 3 smoke).
; Names bind on first occurrence starting at USER_SLOT_BASE (0x50).
; Use multi-letter names so the slotOf bind path is exercised (single-letter
; names collide with hex parsing).
; Expected binding: foo → 0x50, bar → 0x51, baz → 0x52.
; Layout: H_00 SET foo=0x2A ; SET bar=0x07 ; ADDV foo,bar ; RET.

40 00
  30 foo 2A
  30 bar 07
  68 foo bar
  FF